hromoendoscopy. Gastrointest Endosc. 2015;81(2):249 261. ( 10.1016/j.gie.2014.06.020) [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 11. Olympus. NARROW BAND IMAGING (NBI) A New Wave of Diagnostic Possibilities. 2015. Available at: https://www.olympus-europa.com/medical/rmt/media/en/Content/Content-MSD/Images/SCP-Pages/EndoAtlas/E0428859-NBIClinical_brochure_EN.pdf. Accessed May 4, 2021. [ Google Scholar ] 12. Hewett DG, Kaltenbach T, Sano Y, et al. Validation of a simple classification system for endoscopic diagnosis of small colorectal polyps using narrow-band imaging. Gastroenterology. 2012;143(3):599 607.e1. ( 10.1053/j.gastro.2012.05.006) [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 13. Hayashi N, Tanaka S, Hewett DG, et al. Endoscopic prediction of deep submucosal invasive carcinoma: validation of the Narrow-Band Imaging International Colorectal Endoscopic (NICE) classification. Gastrointest Endosc. 2013;78(4):625 632. ( 10.1016/j.gie.2013.04.185) [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 14. Online kappa calculator. Available at: http://justusrandolph.net/kappa/. Accessed May 4, 2021. [ Google Scholar ] 15. Mandrekar JN. Receiver operating characteristic curve in diagnostic test assessment. J Thorac Oncol. 2010;5(9):1315 1316. ( 10.1097/JTO.0b013e3181ec173d) [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 16. Puig I, López-Cerón M, Arnau A, et al. Accuracy of the narrow-band imaging international colorectal endoscopic classification system in identification of deep invasion in colorectal polyps. Gastroenterology. 2019;156(1):75 87. ( 10.1053/j.gastro.2018.10.004) [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 17. Repici A, Ciscato C, Correale L, et al. Narrow-band Imaging International Colorectal Endoscopic Classification to predict polyp histology: REDEFINE study (with videos). Gastrointest Endosc. 2016;84(3):479 486.e3. ( 10.1016/j.gie.2016.02.020) [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 18. Patrun J, Okreša L, Iveković H, Rustemović N. Diagnostic accuracy of NICE classification system for optical