form. 2017; 9:61. [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 30. Open Biological and Biomedical Ontology The Open Biological and Biomedical Ontology (OBO) Foundry. 2021; OBO Technical Working Group; (05 October 2021, date last accessed) http://www.obofoundry.org/ . [ Google Scholar ] 31. National Toxicology Program DNTP Pathology Dictionary National Toxicology Program (NTP). 2021; (05 October 2021, date last accessed) https://cebs.niehs.nih.gov/cebs/paper/15179 . [ Google Scholar ] 32. Gollapudi B.B., Lynch A.M., Heflich R.H., Dertinger S.D., Dobrovolsky V.N., Froetschl R., Horibata K., Kenyon M.O., Kimoto T., Lovell D.P.et al.. The in vivo Pig-a assay: a report of the International Workshop on Genotoxicity Testing (IWGT) Workgroup. Mutat Res. Genet. Toxicol. Environ. Mutagen. 2015; 783:23–35. [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 33. Lin D., Crabtree J., Dillo I., Downs R.R., Edmunds R., Giaretta D., De Gusti M., L’Hours H., Hugo W., Jenkyns R.et al.. The TRUST Principles for digital repositories. Scientific Data. 2020; 7:144. [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] Associated Data This section collects any data citations, data availability statements, or supplementary materials included in this article. Supplementary Materials gkab981_Supplemental_Files Click here for additional data file. (2.2MB, zip) Data Availability Statement The public repository is available from the NTP website: https://cebs.niehs.nih.gov/cebs/ , also accessible via https://doi.org/10.22427/NTP-DATA-1 . The database is registered with NIEHS and accessioned under NTP-DATA-1.',18,'2025-10-15 10:02:58','2025-10-15 10:02:58');
